/editorial/a/f2/af2192eb-6495-4f16-95ce-2a84028a6596/689a77d7a8f08.image.jpg?resize=1200%2C799 1200w, https://bloximages.newyork1.vip.townnews.com/nashvillescene.com/content/tncms/assets/v3/editorial/a/f2/af2192eb-6495-4f16-95ce-2a84028a6596/689a77d7a8f08.image.jpg?resize=1333%2C887 1333w, https://bloximages.newyork1.vip.townnews.com/nashvillescene.com/content/tncms/assets/v3/editorial/a/f2/af2192eb-6495-4f16-95ce-2a84028a6596/689a77d7a8f08.image.jpg?resize=1476%2C983 1476w, https://bloximages.newyork1.vip.townnews.com/nashvillescene.com/content/tncms/assets/v3/editorial/a/f2/af2192eb-6495-4f16-95ce-2a84028a6596/689a77d7a8f08.image.jpg 2008w" />
                </a>
                
