                    <div id="tncms-region-article_bottom" class="tncms-region hidden-print"><div id="tncms-block-964971" class="tncms-block"><table><tr><td width="10%"></td><td width="35%" margin-right="5px"><a href="https://fwpublishing.ac-page.com/scene_membership"><img src="https://bloximages.newyork1.vip.townnews.com/nashvillescene.com/content/tncms/assets/v3/editorial/0/5b/05b6b1e8-5fe0-11ef-af53-dff9f85fa6ff/66c61f34469a2.image.png" width="90%"></a></td><td width="1%"></td><td width="54%">
<h3>Like what you read?</h3><br><i><a href="https://fwpublishing.ac-page.com/scene_membership">Click here to become a member of the</a></i><b> Scene</b> <i>!</i></td></tr></table><br><br></div></div>

